  "scope": "The entire released product computation facade, restored projection/capture accounting, fixed limits, typed failure classification and diagnostics move to the command adapter over the unchanged HIR/runtime-core evaluator. Five VM entries are exact reexports. Internal compatibility tests move with implementation; frozen pre-migration VM policy independently compares all IR nodes and capture faults.",
